# Picking a message: details (route and relays), reply with @[Name], Tab completion of a
# name, and a thread found by following mentions back, from which Enter jumps into the chat.
vim on
rx chan 0 Grace Park|Anyone up for the net tonight?
rx chan 0 Grace Park|I can host if nobody else wants to
rx chan 0 Ridge 900|Pretty quiet up here
rx chan 0 Bob|@[Grace Park] count me in
rx chan 0 Ridge 900|@[Bob] bring a spare battery
wait 300
key enter
shot thread-chat
# Right picks the message at the bottom; Enter shows what is known about it.
key l
shot thread-picked
key enter
shot thread-details
key esc
# t: the thread of the picked message (Bob's reply, and Ridge's before it, and Grace's before that).
key t
shot thread-view
key up
shot thread-view-up
# Enter goes to that message in the whole chat.
key enter
shot thread-jumped
# r: reply to whoever wrote the picked message.
key r
shot thread-reply
type thanks
key enter
# Tab completes a name after @.
key i
type @Ri
key tab
shot thread-tab
key tab
shot thread-tab-next
key esc
# A DM has one other person: no reply or thread keys, and the hints leave them out.
key esc
key q
key down
key enter
key l
shot thread-dm-picked
key r
key t
shot thread-dm-no-reply
